# Wiki documentation context

The `/docs/` folder is the **Mintlify wiki** source (private repo until published).

- **Separate lifecycle**: Nested git repository (`github.com/worldrepublicorg/docs`), gitignored in the main app repo.
- **User-visible app changes**: Update wiki pages when behavior is public; follow [world-republic-docs.mdc](../../docs/.cursor/rules/world-republic-docs.mdc).
- **Privacy**: Never copy private `org/` content into `docs/`.
